PROJECT: Axie Infinity

Event ID

EV-001

Date

2018

Event Name

Pendirian Sky Mavis dan Konsep Axie Infinity

Event Type

Founding

Description

Trung Thanh Nguyen, Aleksander Leonard Larsen, Jeffrey Zirlin, Tu Doan, dan Andy Ho mendirikan Sky Mavis untuk membangun game blockchain berbasis NFT. Konsep awal Axie Infinity dikembangkan sebagai game pet-breeding turn-based strategy.

Participants

Sky Mavis Pte. Ltd.; Trung Thanh Nguyen; Aleksander Leonard Larsen; Jeffrey Zirlin; Tu Doan; Andy Ho

Location

Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam; Singapura

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Terciptanya entitas pengembang dan visi awal protokol Axie Infinity.

Sources

https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/
https://skyma.vis/about
https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/sky-mavis

