Event ID

EV-014

Date

2022-03-23

Event Name

Eksploitasi Ronin Bridge — Kerugian ~$625M (173.600 ETH + 25.5M USDC)

Event Type

Security

Description

Penyerang mengkompromi 5 dari 9 validator key Ronin Bridge (4 validator Sky Mavis + 1 validator Axie DAO) melalui backdoor gas-free RPC node. Menggunakan signature yang valid, penyerang menarik 173.600 ETH dan 25.5M USDC dari bridge contract di Ethereum Mainnet. Terdeteksi 6 hari kemudian oleh user yang gagal withdraw.

Participants

Ronin Bridge; Sky Mavis Pte. Ltd.; Ronin Network; Axie Infinity Community Treasury; Ethereum; CertiK; Verichains; PeckShield; FBI; Chainalysis

Location

Ethereum Mainnet (Ronin Bridge Contract); Ronin Mainnet

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Ronin Bridge dihentikan; jaringan Ronin berhenti memproses deposit/withdraw; AXS/SLP harga anjlok; investigasi forensik dimulai; Sky Mavis komitmen restitusi.

Sources

https://blog.roninchain.com/post-mortem-ronin-bridge-exploit
https://www.certik.com/alerts
https://www.coindesk.com/business/2022/03/29/ronin-bridge-hack-axie-infinity-625-million/
https://www.theblock.co/post/140000/ronin-bridge-hack-625-million

---

