Participants

Sky Mavis Pte. Ltd.; Binance; Ronin Bridge; Ronin Network; Axie Infinity Community Treasury

Location

Global / On-chain

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

User di-refund 1 ETH per 1 ETH rugi; bridge beroperasi kembali dengan keamanan ditingkatkan.

