Event ID

EV-030

Date

2018-2021

Event Name

Migrasi dari Loom Network ke Ronin Network

Event Type

Migration

Description

Axie Infinity bermigrasi dari Loom Network (Plasma/Basechain) ke Ronin Network (Sidechain EVM custom). Proses melibatkan bridge NFT Axie, SLP, dan state game. Migrasi bertahap 2020 (Testnet) hingga 2021 (Mainnet). Loom Network akhirnya menurunkan dukungan gaming.

Participants

Sky Mavis Pte. Ltd.; Axie Infinity (Game Protocol); Loom Network; Ronin Network; Ethereum

Location

Loom Network -> Ronin Network (via Ethereum Bridge)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Kemandirian infrastruktur; kontrol penuh konsensus; UX gas-free; skalabilitas tinggi.

Sources

https://axieinfinity.medium.com/ronin-mainnet-launch-9-february-2021
https://medium.com/loom-network/axie-infinity-launches-on-loom-network-
https://docs.roninchain.com/

